00:48:48,008 --> 00:48:52,179
I'm here to ask you something.

784
00:48:54,223 --> 00:48:56,517
Later. It's late.

785
00:48:58,310 --> 00:48:59,478
No.

786
00:49:02,022 --> 00:49:04,150
It has to be now.

787
00:49:05,943 --> 00:49:07,153
Yeon-su.

788
00:49:10,030 --> 00:49:11,699
Did you even love me?

789
00:49:12,408 --> 00:49:13,868
<i>When the question was not</i>
<i>whether I loved him</i>

790
00:49:13,951 --> 00:49:15,661
<i>but whether I had ever loved him</i>

791
00:49:15,744 --> 00:49:18,164
- Yes?
<i>- I realized</i>

792
00:49:18,247 --> 00:49:21,542
<i>that he was another crack in me.</i>

793
00:49:22,793 --> 00:49:24,253
I knew it.

794
00:49:25,379 --> 00:49:27,381
If you'd really loved me

795
00:49:27,923 --> 00:49:30,968
you wouldn't have made a fool
out of me for a year.

796
00:49:31,969 --> 00:49:34,638
- Seung-jun...
- You know what?

797
00:49:35,389 --> 00:49:38,893
I really loved you.

798
00:49:39,810 --> 00:49:43,063
All my friends called me an idiot.

799
00:49:43,481 --> 00:49:44,690
But I...

800
00:49:45,983 --> 00:49:47,485
I loved you.

801
00:49:49,236 --> 00:49:53,115
This platonic love was damn boring...

802
00:49:54,575 --> 00:49:55,743
but...

803
00:49:58,078 --> 00:50:00,539
I loved you so much.

804
00:50:02,708 --> 00:50:03,876
Gosh.

805
00:50:08,547 --> 00:50:09,757
Yeon-su.

806
00:50:10,341 --> 00:50:12,885
I'm sorry.

807
00:50:14,053 --> 00:50:16,388
Can we get back together again?

808
00:50:16,472 --> 00:50:19,058
We'll go have
your favorite shaved ice.

809
00:50:19,141 --> 00:50:21,352
And we'll go to the farm
you wanted to go in Jeju Island.

810
00:50:21,435 --> 00:50:23,020
I'll be good.

811
00:50:23,771 --> 00:50:25,272
So, Yeon-su.

812
00:50:33,697 --> 00:50:35,032
Let's do it.

813
00:50:39,203 --> 00:50:40,412
- What?
- I mean...

814
00:50:40,746 --> 00:50:42,748
We couldn't do it last time.

815
00:50:42,831 --> 00:50:45,459
If you want, I'll put the condom on.

816
00:50:45,543 --> 00:50:47,336
So let me check

817
00:50:47,419 --> 00:50:49,797
if you really love me.

818
00:50:50,839 --> 00:50:53,676
<i>You're clearly the wrong answer.</i>

819
00:50:53,759 --> 00:50:55,427
Yeon-su, please?

820
00:50:56,595 --> 00:50:59,848
Go.
I don't want to talk to you anymore.

821
00:50:59,932 --> 00:51:01,392
Wait.

822
00:51:01,684 --> 00:51:04,270
- Let me go.
- Yeon-su, please.

823
00:51:05,396 --> 00:51:06,689
- Three...
- Hey.

824
00:51:06,772 --> 00:51:08,816
Do I really have to do this?

825
00:51:09,066 --> 00:51:10,609
Two...

826
00:51:10,693 --> 00:51:12,403
We even thought
about getting married.

827
00:51:12,486 --> 00:51:15,364
- One...
- Come on, you bitch!

828
00:51:37,011 --> 00:51:38,304
What do you want me to do to him?

829
00:51:50,482 --> 00:51:54,320
MAKE ME TINGLE

830
00:52:18,927 --> 00:52:21,972
Hi, Mr. Dokgo. What's up?

831
00:52:23,849 --> 00:52:25,309
The alley
next to the self-service motel

832
00:52:25,392 --> 00:52:26,685
after the intersection.

833
00:52:27,019 --> 00:52:28,187
Please hurry up.

834
00:52:28,854 --> 00:52:31,690
- It's urgent.
- Look at you.

835
00:52:31,774 --> 00:52:34,276
I guess you're worried.

836
00:52:34,360 --> 00:52:36,820
Okay. I'm on my way.

837
00:52:36,904 --> 00:52:38,322
Thank you.

838
00:54:09,580 --> 00:54:11,540
Subtitles by Songmi You
